---
source: crates/wisp-tui/src/app/config_screen/tests/edit.rs
expression: "rows.join(\"\\n\")"
---
Agent type: needs a name of 1 to 32 of a-z, 0-9, _ and -, starting with a letter or digit
Agents per tree: a whole number, 1 to 50, or none
Agent depth: a whole number, 1 to 5, or none
Running children: a whole number, 1 to 16, or none
Running per tree: a whole number, 1 to 50, or none
Wake when stuck: a whole number, 0 to 1440
Keep-warm refreshes: a whole number, 0 to 24
Aliases: needs a list of model IDs
Sign-in: must be one of api_key, bearer, anthropic_subscription, chatgpt_subscription, antigravity_subscription
Cache lifetime: must be 5m or 1h
Claude usage lookup: must be on or off
Client version: a version such as 1.2.3
Compact at: tokens, or a share such as 60%
Compact automatically: must be on or off
Background compaction: must be on or off
Background start: tokens, 1 or more
Summary effort: must be one of low, medium, high, xhigh, max
Context line: must be on or off
Count with the server: must be on or off
Compaction strategy: needs default or a plugin id of 2 to 32 characters of a-z, 0-9 and -, starting with a letter
