Colour: must be one of auto, truecolor, 256, 16, none
Copy on select: must be one of auto, on, off
Full repaint: must be on or off
Motion: must be one of auto, full, calm, reduced
Mouse: must be on or off
Pictures: must be on or off
Scroll speed: a whole number, 1 to 20
Sidebar: must be auto or hidden
Folded sections: must be none or a list of sidebar sections, each <plugin>/<name>
Pinned sections: must be none or a list of sidebar sections, each <plugin>/<name>
Theme: must be one of auto, dark, light
Verbose: must be on or off
Effort: must be one of low, medium, high, xhigh, max
Account: needs a name of 1 to 32 of a-z, 0-9, _ and -, starting with a letter or digit
Extra instructions: must be none or autonomous
Instructions: must be one of auto, default, none
Instructions warning: tokens, 0 or more
Keep main warm: must be on or off
Key: is a secret
Key variable: a variable name of letters, digits and _
Key kept in: must be file or keyring
Keychain: must be one of auto, on, off
Session log: must be on or off
Requests in flight: a whole number, 1 to 64, or none
Max output: tokens, 1 to 4,294,967,295
Message threads: must be on or off
Model: needs a model ID of letters, digits and . _ : @ / -
Provider compaction: must be on or off
Native web search: must be on or off
Plugin: must be on or off
Plugin hook: must be on or off
Installed: must be on or off
Sidebar section: must be on or off
Start with: must be core, none, or a list of tool names; none must stand alone
Main preset: needs a name of 1 to 32 of a-z, 0-9, _ and -, starting with a letter or digit
Cache read price: US dollars
Input price: US dollars
Output price: US dollars
Pricing: must be list or none
Provider: must be one of anthropic, openai, gemini
Refusal fallback: must be on or off
Retry budget: US dollars, or none
Self-check: must be on or off
Store ID: must be one of 
Message time: must be one of local, utc, off
Tool output kept: a whole number, 1 to 3650, or none
Tools: must be none or a list of tool names
Turned off: must be none or a list of names
URL: is a secret
URL variable: a variable name of letters, digits and _
Voice account: needs a name of 1 to 32 of a-z, 0-9, _ and -, starting with a letter or digit
Voice instructions: needs a file path, relative to config.toml's directory, under ~/ or absolute
Language: needs a two-letter language code (ISO 639-1), such as en
Voice: needs a voice's name of 1 to 32 of a-z, 0-9, _ and -, starting with a letter or digit
Web search: must be none or a list of one of web_search_20250305, web_search, google_search
